cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Comparative Text Analysis: The Simpsons and Family Guy"
abstract: >
  Text mining and NLP analysis of The Simpsons and Family Guy scripts. Compares the
  two shows through word frequency analysis, topic modeling (LDA and STM), and
  sentiment analysis. Correlates results with IMDb episode ratings.
